	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Fuimus hactenus implicatissimi in con<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>gerenda responsione, quae per nos magistratui <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>danda fuit de conventu futuro<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Die <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> Theologen lehnten in ihrem Gutachten zum <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Anstand das geplante Religionsgespräch entschieden ab; s. <hi>Moeller,</hi> <persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> 218-220.</note>, atque pendente <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ista deliberatione<pb type="edition" next="162"/> nichil potui ad te certo scribere.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Nunc, cum certissimus nuntius<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p8440">Gervasius Schuler</persName> (vgl. unten Z. 12-18).</note> contigerit et re<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sponsum nostrum senatui hoc mane obtulerimus<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">et responsum ... obtulerimus <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, statui morem tibi gerere et nostra mittere, ex <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quibus intelliges, quod voluisti.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Proinde et <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>meam privatam deliberationem mitto<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p4079">Zwicks</persName> Privatgutachten scheint nicht erhalten zu sein.</note>, sed <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>omnia ea lege, mi frater, ne quisquam legat aut <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>habeat te uno excepto, imo ne tabellio sciat, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quid miserim; expedit enim mussitare in istis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nec prodere sententiam ante tempus; alioqui <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>enim satis astutas deliberationes quidam habent, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut non opus sit illos contra<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>vor</hi> contra <hi>ein gestrichenes Zeichen.</hi></note> nos armare.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Itaque tu, cui tanquam candidissimo fratri bene fidimus, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>lege ista et, si quę placent, excerpe paucis, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut nostra scripta per <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName> illum nostrum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>charissimum fratrem remittas; ęgerrime enim caremus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>exemplariis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>De causis conventus quęre <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName>; hunc <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>intelligo omnia habere in promptu, nam ad illum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>scripsit <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Ein entsprechendes Schreiben ist nicht überliefert.</note>, ad nos hactenus ne verbum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>quidem<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Die Behauptung ist falsch; <persName ref="p467">Bucer</persName> hatte am 30. April an <persName ref="p8055">Ambrosius Blarer</persName> geschrieben (s. <bibl source="b51">Blarer BW</bibl> II 23f, Nr. 840; vgl. oben <ref target="file11324">Nr. 1281</ref>, 14-45).</note>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Et ne non omnia tibi in aurem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>libere dicam, suspicor <persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName> hortatu<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vor</hi> hortatu <hi>ein gestrichener Wortanfang.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p467">Buceri</persName> hanc profectionem suscepisse.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>falsus esse possum; nam biennium ante intellexi <lb xml:id="p1z27"/><persName ref="p8440">Gervasium</persName> cupidissimum esse te visendi<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <bibl source="b9">HBBW VII</bibl> <ref target="file11066">[Nr. 1024]</ref>, S. 200, 3-12; 234, 15-19; 240, 36f; 286, 9f.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Scripsi nuper <persName ref="p8049">Vadiano</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Am 4. Juni (s. <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW V 561f, <ref target="file11104">Nr. 1061</ref>).</note> quaedam de conventu illo; <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>sed sic respondet<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p8049">Vadians</persName> Antwort ist nicht erhalten; vgl. aber <persName ref="p4079">Zwicks</persName> Reaktion darauf in seinem Brief an <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> vom 30. Juni (<persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW V 564).</note>, ut intelligam eum forte per Bu[cerum] <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>probe instructum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sed quid tandem dicamus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>omnes?<pb type="scan" next="111v."/></s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>O pater in cęlis, fiat voluntas tua<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 6, 9f</ref></cit>.</note> etc.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Proinde epistolam habes a <persName ref="p8049">Vadiano</persName> scriptam de <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>discrimine inter deificationem et glorificationem <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Christi<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Teildruck: <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl>, <ref target="file10936">Nr. 894</ref>; vgl. oben <ref target="file11300">Nr. 1257</ref>, Anm. 24.</note>, quam iussit a te petere, ut legam<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p4079">Zwick</persName> hatte sich bei <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> nach diesem Brief erkundigt; s. <persName ref="p8049">Vadian</persName> BW V 562.</note>; <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>lectam vero quamprimum tibi remisero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/>Quodsi vacaret scribere aliquid <persName ref="p7604">Khienringio</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p7604">Balthasar von Kuenring</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>et libellum mittere De origine errorum<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Zu <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> "De origine errons libri duo" <bibl source="b286">HBBibl</bibl> I 12) s. oben <ref target="file11280">Nr. 1237</ref>, Anm. 7.</note> etc., <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>posses cum <persName ref="p8440">Gervasio</persName> mittere; nam commodum <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>esset illi mittere intra dies octo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z10"/>Quod prole auctus es<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> est.</note><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="14">Zur Geburt von <persName ref="p21014">Johannes Bullinger</persName> s. oben <ref target="file11320">Nr. 1277</ref>, Anm. 17.</note>, felix sit et faustum utrisque <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>parentibus, cum primis vero regno Christi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Salutabis puerperam<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="15"><persName ref="p8051">Anna, geb. Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> totamque domum.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>18. iunii 1539<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Tuus <persName ref="p4079">Io. Zvick</persName>.<pb type="edition" next="163"/></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z21"/>Articulos tuos<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">Gemeint ist vielleicht <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Stellungnahme zum <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Anstand; vgl. oben <ref target="file11316">Nr. 1273</ref>, Anm. 5.</note> remitto, qui nobis summe pro<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>bantur; gratiam autem habeo, quod legendos miseris<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf f. 112v.:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Ornatissimo viro domino <lb xml:id="p4z2"/><persName ref="p495">Hainricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>fratri suo per omnia <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>